{"id":"549cf65f429db76a","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map.md","title":"ZFC Meas Measure Preserving Map","display":"df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map — ZFC Meas Measure Preserving Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map","58-df-zfc-measure6-measure-preserving-map","58-df-zfc-measure8-measure-preserving-map"],"display":"df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map — ZFC Meas Measure Preserving Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-measure-preserving-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-measure-preserving-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map — ZFC Meas Measure Preserving Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\">\\((Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\)</span> (measure spaces, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:X\\to Y\">\\(T:X\\to Y\\)</span> (candidate measure-preserving function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\Omega,\\Lambda\">\\(f,\\Omega,\\Lambda\\)</span> (merged parameters for variant predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurePreservingMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurePreservingMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (merged alias predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\\)</span>；函数图及定义域使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S(T,\\mu,\\nu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\land T:X\\to Y\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(T^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[B])=\\nu(B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S(T,\\mu,\\nu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\land T:X\\to Y\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(T^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mu(T^{-1}[B])=\\nu(B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurePreservingMap}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S(f,\\mu,\\nu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurePreservingMap}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S(f,\\mu,\\nu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\math